  "claim_status": "source_derived_unreviewed",
  "reported_status": "Source-derived arguments and inspected producer replay; new extensions separately identified as integration-derived. Source and internally derived claims remain unreviewed. External correctness, historical priority and physical validity are UNKNOWN. Exact/floating diagnostics, producer-code replay and same-team analytic criticism do not independently validate universal mathematics, novelty or scientific capability.",
  "scientific_scope_status": "Finite fixed-particle occupation model with real diagonal D, baseline hop-coherence damping eta>0 and separately applicable actual-D phases. The supplied symmetric NIG law achieves a97% weak-hopping edge-rate guarantee and reversible-form comparisons. New internal proofs give an all-hopping absolute current floor for uniform periodic hopping and a volume-uniform competitive ratio only in the noninteracting staggered class. No general interacting97% actual-current theorem or physical advantage.",
